    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat hostile creatures and overcome the many dangers of the Forest Floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/4a15f660d301c7861c173495c606e48f.poster.avif?t=1745530998\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/4a15f660d301c7861c173495c606e48f.webm?t=1745530998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/4a15f660d301c7861c173495c606e48f.mp4?t=1745530998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send mushkin to collect fruits, defeated enemies, and other resources to grow your colony</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/13a63c952006101292e45f4be63c8110.poster.avif?t=1745530998\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/13a63c952006101292e45f4be63c8110.webm?t=1745530998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/13a63c952006101292e45f4be63c8110.mp4?t=1745530998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover helpful creatures that speed up resource processing and produce nutrients</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414360/extras/e284500f960754c9f4071ce2a1fe0746.poster.avif?t=1745530998\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"http